            "bbox": [
                0.134,
                0.334,
                0.69,
                0.39
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解: \\( f(t) \\xrightarrow{\\text{右2}} f(t-2) \\xrightarrow{\\text{压缩}} f(2t-2) \\)",
